        <mxCell id="catalogue-left" value="&lt;b&gt;1  Capture-scan lag&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Grace-window headroom (sev2); Repair-read storm (sev2)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2  Environment recreate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Scheduled event; alert suppression window; no active alert or severity&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3  Entra token edge cases&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Doomed reconnect loop (sev2)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4  Poison event, head-of-line blocking&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Systemic poison (sev1); Parking failure (sev1); Parked events present (sev2)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5  Consumer rebalance redelivery&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rebalances, spot evictions, repair throttling (sev3)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6  Mid-stream or head gap&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Loss-rate trend (sev2)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7  Tail loss&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tail-drift rate (sev2)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1">
